  IconPath: systems/pf2e/icons/features/ancestry/smokeworker-hobgoblin.webp
  Description: Your family have been alchemists, engineers, and scientists for generations,
    laboring on projects that bring smoke and fire to the field of battle. You gain
    fire resistance equal to half your level (minimum 1). You automatically succeed
    at the DC 5 flat check to target a @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Concealed]
    creature if that creature is concealed only by smoke.
